OL,3,GNEWSAThree injured in M6 van and car
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been injured in a
OL,7,Fcrash involving a van and a car, which
OL,8,Fclosed part of a motorway in both
OL,9,Fdirections, causing severe delays.
OL,11,FCheshire Police said the collision
OL,12,Fhappened at about 03:30 GMT on the
OL,13,Fnorthbound M6 at junction 20 near
OL,14,FWarrington, where it meets the M56 at
OL,15,FLymm Interchange.
OL,17,FThe M6 southbound has now reopened but
OL,18,Fnorthbound remains closed with long
OL,19,Fdelays due to recovery work, traffic
OL,20,Fmonitoring service Inrix has said.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
