OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic England said vehicles had been
OL,7,Fdiverted off the M6 via the exit and
OL,8,Fentry slip roads and later reported
OL,9,Fdelays of 90 minutes, with tailbacks of
OL,10,Fabout eight miles (13km).
